DATA NOTICE / AVISO SOBRE DATOS

This MIT license applies to the SOURCE CODE of this project (Godot scripts,
scenes, schemas, and similar artifacts written by the author).

This project also includes JSON files in `data/teams/` that contain references
to real Spanish football clubs and players (names, kits colors, stadium names,
etc.) as of the 2025-26 season. These references are used solely for
identification and educational purposes within a personal, non-commercial
simulation project.

The names, brands, and trademarks referenced (e.g. "Real Madrid", "Athletic
Club", "La Liga", "Copa del Rey", and the names of individual football
players) are property of their respective owners. This project is not
endorsed by, affiliated with, or sponsored by La Liga, the Royal Spanish
Football Federation (RFEF), any club, or any player.

No logos, crests, photographs, audio, or other branded media of these
entities are included or distributed via this repository. The textual
references are limited to what is necessary to identify a team or player
within the simulation.

If you are a rights holder and have concerns about the use of any specific
reference, please contact the author at antxiko@gmail.com.
